{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01IE:statement", "parent_tag": "01I6", "chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>\nbe an affine scheme. Suppose that\n<MATH_0002>\nis a short exact sequence of sheaves of <MATH_0003>-modules.\nIf two out of three are quasi-coherent then so is the third.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, \\mathcal{O}_X) = (\\Spec(R), \\mathcal{O}_{\\Spec(R)})$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n0 \\to\n\\mathcal{F}_1 \\to\n\\mathcal{F}_2 \\to\n\\mathcal{F}_3 \\to\n0\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-extension-quasi-coherent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:f7b3ce323d460b584b6ecda91961b0f2a76c8abebc8541a9ca0c5e551997209b", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:523826c8a045c12c3bbd575273777dbcc2f727611a17af3b4ea5dd6db4410c50", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3ab3784646c5e9dce2c113985c8bb5939744c2c8486d57d9f83da5956da614e7"}
